            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Volatile Sap",
            "sort": 600000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When a mannoq beast is dealt damage by a melee weapon that lacks the reach property, that weapon's wielder takes @Damage[(1d8+5)[fire]] damage from the mannoq beast's explosive sap. When a mannoq beast rolls a critical hit on a branch Strike or a creature critically fails its Reflex save against the mannoq beast's explosive fruit, the target takes @Damage[1d8[persistent,fire]] damage as caustic sap sticks to its body.</p>"
                },
